re, Murat, and many more.  More than 30 characters with different backgrounds and skills are available for you to command. Train your commanders to improve their special abilities, but also talk to them to win their trust and understand their hearts, and you will be an unstoppable force on the battlefield!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/ed466a4564119317cb57abf736666abd.poster.avif?t=1750908909\" width=600 height=268 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/ed466a4564119317cb57abf736666abd.webm?t=1750908909\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/extras/ed466a4564119317cb57abf736666abd.mp4?t=1750908909\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","developers":["Azure Flame Studio"],"dlc":[1139930,996820],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/994730/259d97ec35c7d02bec6d2e98f32babd03cddad8a/header.jpg?t=1750908909","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Developed by Azure Flame Studio. Published by 2P Games. 2P Games, Banner of the Maid and the 2P Games and Banner of the Maid logos are trademarks and/or registered trademarks. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/994730/722421/0503b353206f306de3c6734fecb1f32ed6d0e54e/1750605076/dash_av1.mpd?t=1720148866","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/994730/722421/0503b353206f306de3c6734fecb1f32ed6d0e54e/1750605076/dash_h264.mpd?t=1720148866","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/994730/722421/0503b353206f306de3c6734fecb1f32ed6d0e54e/1